    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "1.\nHeard the learned counsel appearing for the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 721,
      "end": 777,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "2. The petitioner is the husband.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 778,
      "end": 812,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "3. Considering the materials available in the case diary and the statement of the neighbours directly implicating the petitioner along with his father for causing physical and mental torture and the victim has died within four years of marriage, we are not inclined to grant anticipatory bail to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 813,
      "end": 1125,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. Accordingly, the prayer for anticipatory bail of the petitioner is rejected and the same is accordingly disposed of.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1127,
      "end": 1246,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06278613209724426
    },
